{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":246,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"7f4e2ecc-b50c-4df9-a375-87d66e33e660","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151123591,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"PEMFC电堆结构设计岗(J12439)","OrgId":700228224,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1负责燃料电池电堆模块及关键机械部件的详细结构设计。\r\n2进行公差分析、DFM（可制造性设计）和DFA（可装配性设计）分析，确保设计的可实施性。\r\n3负责新产品的样机试制、装配跟进，解决生产装配过程中的机械问题。\r\n4绘制极板及电堆模块相关零部件二维工程图，编制BOM表和技术规格书，支持采购和生产。\r\n5与供应商进行技术沟通，完成外协机加工件、钣金件、模具件的技术确认和质量把控。\r\n6支持燃料电池电堆模块的总装和测试工作。","Require":"本科及以上；机械设计制造及其自动化、车辆工程、机械工程、动力机械等相关专业（燃料电池方向优先）；3年以上相关领域研发或设计工作经验；1熟练使用CREO机械设计软件进行结构设计、工程图设计；\r\n2熟悉GD&T（几何尺寸与公差），机加工，铸造，焊接，冲压等知识，并能应用零件设计工作中；\r\n3动手能力强，能配合样机组装测试和数据采集分析工作。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-07T17:02:31","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"81cc8831-be96-4fda-91ca-76e3d08afa4b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId"